rline-offset-4">Translation models</a></h2><div class="mt-3 space-y-3 leading-relaxed text-obsidian/80 [&amp;_a]:font-medium [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:decoration-orange-accent [&amp;_a]:decoration-2 [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-4 [&amp;_li]:ml-5 [&amp;_li]:list-disc [&amp;_li]:pl-1 [&amp;_strong]:text-obsidian [&amp;_ul]:space-y-1.5"><p>Caption translation runs on-device in your browser with OPUS-MT models by<!-- --> <span class="font-semibold">Helsinki-NLP (Language Technology Research Group, University of Helsinki)</span>, converted to ONNX for Transformers.js. Nothing you translate is uploaded. Each model below is credited under its licence; the German model is CC-BY-4.0 and is used with attribution to Helsinki-NLP as its licence requires.</p><ul class="space-y-3"><li><a href="https://huggingface.co/Helsinki-NLP/opus-mt-en-es" class="font-semibold underline underline-offset-2" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">English → <!-- -->Spanish<!-- -->: <!-- -->Helsinki-NLP/opus-mt-en-es</a><span class="text-obsidian/60"> <!-- -->· <!-- -->Apache-2.0<!-- --> · © <!-- -->Helsinki-NLP (Language Technology Research Group, University of Helsinki)<!-- --> · ONNX mirror: <!-- -->Xenova/opus-mt-en-es</span></li><li><a href="https://huggingface.co/Helsinki-NLP/opus-mt-en-de" class="font-semibold underline underline-offset-2" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">English → <!-- -->German<!-- -->: <!-- -->Helsinki-NLP/opus-mt-en-de</a><span class="text-obsidian/60"> <!-- -->· <!-- -->CC-BY-4.0<!-- --> · © <!-- -->Helsinki-NLP (Language Technology Research Group, University of Helsinki)<!-- --> · ONNX mirror: <!-- -->Xenova/opus-mt-en-de</span></li><li><a href="https://huggingface.co/Helsinki-NLP/opus-mt-en-fr" class="font-semibold underline underline-offset-2" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">English → <!-- -->French<!-- -->: <!-- -->Helsinki-NLP/opus-mt-en-fr</a><span class="text-obsidian/60"> <!-- -->· <!-- -->Apache-2.0<!-- --> · © <!-- -->Helsinki-NLP (Language Technology Research Group, University of Helsinki)<!-- --> · ONNX mirror: <!-- -->Xenova/opus-mt-en-fr</span></li><li><a href="https://huggingface.co/Helsinki-NLP/opus-mt-en-hi" class="font-semibold underline underline-offset-2" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">English → <!-- -->Hindi<!-- -->: <!-- -->Helsinki-NLP/opus-mt-en-hi</a><span class="text-obsidian/60"> <!-- -->· <!-- -->Apache-2.0<!-- --> · © <!-- -->Helsinki-NLP (Language Technology Research Group, University of Helsinki)<!-- --> · ONNX mirror: <!-- -->Xenova/opus-mt-en-hi</span></li><li><a href="https://huggingface.co/Helsinki-NLP/opus-mt-en-it" class="font-semibold underline underline-offset-2" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">English → <!-- -->Italian<!-- -->: <!-- -->Helsinki-NLP/opus-mt-en-it</a><span class="text-obsidian/60"> <!-- -->· <!-- -->Apache-2.0<!-- --> · © <!-- -->Helsinki-NLP (Language Technology Research Group, University of Helsinki)<!-- --> · ONNX mirror: <!-- -->Xenova/opus-mt-en-it</span></li></ul></div></section><section id="face-model" class="scroll-mt-24"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-2xl"><a href="#face-model" class="hover:underline hover:decoration-orange-accent hover:decoration-2 hover:underline-offset-4">Face detection model</a></h2><div class="mt-3 space-y-3 leading-relaxed text-obsidian/80 [&amp;_a]:font-medium [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:decoration-orange-accent [&amp;_a]:decoration-2 [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-4 [&amp;_li]:ml-5 [&amp;_li]:list-disc [&amp;_li]:pl-1 [&amp;_strong]:text-obsidian [&amp;_ul]:space-y-1.5"><p>The clipper’s optional face-centring runs on-device in your browser with<!-- --> <a href="https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo/tree/main/models/face_detection_yunet" class="font-semibold underline underline-offset-2" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">YuNet (face_detection_yunet_2023mar)</a> <!-- -->from the OpenCV Zoo · MIT licence · © Shiqi Yu · about 0.23 MB, loaded from this site only when you ask it to centre a crop window. It detects faces only — no recognition, nothing about the frames leaves your device, and no detection result is stored: the outcome is a crop position you can change, exactly like one you set by dragging. Inference uses ONNX Runtime Web (MIT), the same runtime the speech and text models already use.</p></div></section></div><p class="mt-14 rounded-2xl border border-obsidian/10 bg-muted-beige/40 p-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-obsidian/70">Questions about this document? Write to <strong class="text-obsidian">work.techhacksai@gmail.com</strong>. <!-- -->Parvez Achhan Ali Siddiqui, an individual (sole proprietor) trading as Captionit<!-- -->, <!-- -->India<!-- -->.</p></article><!--$--><!--/$--></main></div><footer class="relative overflow-hidden border-t border-[#FFFFEB]/10 bg-[#1E1E1B] pt-20 pb-10 text-[#FFFFEB]"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-10 md:grid-cols-4 lg:gap-16 pb-16"><div class="space-y-4"><h3 class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FFFFEB]/50">Product</h3><ul class="space-y-0.5 text-sm text-[#FFFFEB]/75 lg:space-y-2.5"><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/#how">How it works</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/pricing">Pricing</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/auto-caption-generator">Auto caption generator</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/transcribe">Transcribe</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/#looks">Looks gallery</a></li><li><a class="i